B.KL=new A.aM(B.bc,["Gerade kein sicherer Tipp \u2014 mach einen Zug r\xfcckg\xe4ngig","Datenschutzerkl\xe4rung","Datenschutz f\xfcr Werbung","Bau ihn r\xfcckw\xe4rts auseinander","Nur sichtbare K\xf6pfe l\xf6sen sich","Volle Ablage blockiert alles","40 Bretter, bis zu 91 Schrauben","Beliebig oft r\xfcckg\xe4ngig","Bau ihn r\xfcckw\xe4rts auseinander","Brett w\xe4hlen","Leicht","Normal","Schwer","Brutal","Schrauben {}","R\xfcckg\xe4ngig","Neu starten","Tipp","Ablage voll \u2014 mach einen Zug r\xfcckg\xe4ngig","Keine Schraube l\xe4sst sich l\xf6sen \u2014 r\xfcckg\xe4ngig","Zeit abgelaufen \u2014 neu starten oder r\xfcckg\xe4ngig","Zerlegt \u2014 {} \xfcbrig","Zerlegt \u2014 {} Schrauben","Nochmal","N\xe4chstes Brett","Einstellungen","Zeitlimit","Aus: ohne Zeitdruck knobeln","Soundeffekte","Musik","Sprache","Werbung entfernen","Kauf wiederherstellen","Werbung entfernt","So wird gespielt","Nur Schrauben mit sichtbarem Kopf lassen sich l\xf6sen. Gel\xf6ste Schrauben landen in der Ablage.\nIst ein Stab komplett frei, f\xe4llt er heraus und gibt seine Pl\xe4tze frei.\nWer wahllos schraubt, verstopft die Ablage \u2014 nimm dir einen Stab nach dem anderen vor.","OK"],t.l)
B.KK=new A.aM(B.bc,["Pas d\u2019indice s\xfbr pour l\u2019instant \u2014 essayez d\u2019annuler un coup","Politique de confidentialit\xe9","Confidentialit\xe9 des publicit\xe9s","D\xe9monte dans l\u2019ordre inverse","Seule une t\xeate visible sort","Plateau plein, tout se bloque","40 plateaux, jusqu\u2019\xe0 91 vis","Annulez autant que vous voulez","D\xe9monte dans l\u2019ordre inverse","Choisir un plateau","Facile","Normal","Difficile","Infernal","Vis {}","Annuler","Recommencer","Indice","Plateau plein \u2014 annulez pour lib\xe9rer une place","Aucune vis ne peut \xeatre retir\xe9e \u2014 annulez","Temps \xe9coul\xe9 \u2014 recommencer ou annuler","D\xe9mont\xe9 \u2014 {} restant","D\xe9mont\xe9 \u2014 {} vis","Rejouer","Plateau suivant","R\xe9glages","Limite de temps","D\xe9sactivez pour jouer sans chrono","Effets sonores","Musique","Langue","Retirer les publicit\xe9s","Restaurer l\u2019achat","Publicit\xe9s retir\xe9es","Comment jouer","On ne retire qu\u2019une vis dont la t\xeate est visible. Les vis retir\xe9es vont dans le plateau.\nQuand une baguette n\u2019a plus de vis, elle tombe et lib\xe8re ses places.\n\xc0 force de piocher au hasard, le plateau se bloque \u2014 terminez une baguette \xe0 la fois.","OK"],t.l)
B.KN=new A.aM(B.bc,["Ahora no hay una pista segura \u2014 prueba a deshacer un movimiento","Pol\xedtica de privacidad","Privacidad de anuncios","Des\xe1rmalo en orden inverso","Solo sale la cabeza visible","Bandeja llena, todo atascado","40 tableros, hasta 91 tornillos","Deshaz cuantas veces quieras","Des\xe1rmalo en orden inverso","Elegir tablero","F\xe1cil","Normal","Dif\xedcil","Brutal","Tornillos {}","Deshacer","Reiniciar","Pista","Bandeja llena \u2014 deshaz para liberar un hueco","No se puede quitar ning\xfan tornillo \u2014 deshaz","Se acab\xf3 el tiempo \u2014 reinicia o deshaz","Desarmado \u2014 quedan {}","Desarmado \u2014 {} tornillos","Otra vez","Siguiente tablero","Ajustes","Tiempo l\xedmite","Desact\xedvalo para jugar sin reloj","Efectos de sonido","M\xfasica","Idioma","Quitar anuncios","Restaurar compra","Anuncios quitados","C\xf3mo se juega","Solo puedes quitar tornillos con la cabeza a la vista. Los tornillos quitados van a la bandeja.\nCuando una varilla se queda sin tornillos, cae y libera esos huecos.\nSi tocas de aqu\xed y de all\xe1 la bandeja se atasca \u2014 termina una varilla a la vez.","OK"],t.l)
B.KO=new A.aM(B.bc,["Sem dica segura agora \u2014 tente desfazer uma jogada","Pol\xedtica de privacidade","Privacidade de an\xfancios","Desmonte na ordem inversa","S\xf3 sai o parafuso \xe0 vista","Bandeja cheia trava tudo","40 tabuleiros, at\xe9 91 parafusos","Desfa\xe7a quantas vezes quiser","Desmonte na ordem inversa","Escolher tabuleiro","F\xe1cil","Normal","Dif\xedcil","Brutal","Parafusos {}","Desfazer","Recome\xe7ar","Dica","Bandeja cheia \u2014 desfa\xe7a para liberar um espa\xe7o","Nenhum parafuso pode sair \u2014 desfa\xe7a","Tempo esgotado \u2014 recomece ou desfa\xe7a","Desmontado \u2014 restam {}","Desmontado \u2014 {} parafusos","De novo","Pr\xf3ximo tabuleiro","Ajustes","Tempo limite","Desligue para jogar sem rel\xf3gio","Efeitos sonoros","M\xfasica","Idioma","Remover an\xfancios","Restaurar compra","An\xfancios removidos","Como jogar","S\xf3 d\xe1 para tirar parafusos com a cabe\xe7a \xe0 vista. Os parafusos v\xe3o para a bandeja.\nQuando uma ripa fica sem parafusos, ela cai e libera aqueles espa\xe7os.\nMexer aqui e ali entope a bandeja \u2014 termine uma ripa de cada vez.","OK"],t.l)
B.KM=new A.aM(B.bc,["Belum ada petunjuk pasti \u2014 coba urungkan satu langkah","Kebijakan privasi","Privasi iklan","Bongkar dengan urutan terbalik","Hanya kepala yang terlihat","Baki penuh berarti macet","40 papan, hingga 91 sekrup","Urungkan sesuka hati","Bongkar dengan urutan terbalik","Pilih papan","Mudah","Normal","Sulit","Brutal","Sekrup {}","Urungkan","Ulangi","Petunjuk","Baki penuh \u2014 urungkan untuk mengosongkan slot","Tidak ada sekrup yang bisa dilepas \u2014 urungkan","Waktu habis \u2014 ulangi atau urungkan","Selesai dibongkar \u2014 sisa {}","Selesai dibongkar \u2014 {} sekrup","Lagi","Papan berikutnya","Pengaturan","Batas waktu","Matikan untuk bermain tanpa waktu","Efek suara","Musik","Bahasa","Hapus iklan","Pulihkan pembelian","Iklan dihapus","Cara bermain","Hanya sekrup yang kepalanya terlihat yang bisa dilepas. Sekrup masuk ke baki.\nJika semua sekrup satu bilah lepas, bilah itu jatuh dan slotnya kosong lagi.\nMelepas asal-asalan membuat baki penuh dan macet \u2014 selesaikan satu bilah dulu.","OK"],t.l)
